silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_representable_profile_concrete_anchor_3_P_visit_0_#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode3 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode3 is the population set P(visit_0) of vet records observed at Mittens' baseline check-up time-point, concretely body-mass 4.0 kg and Alice-as-owner records. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'P(visit_0)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
